{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30949","headline":"罢都统守镇滑州作 · 王铎","name":"罢都统守镇滑州作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"用军何事敢迁延，恩重才轻分使然。\n黜诏已闻来阙下，檄书犹未遍军前。\n腰间尽解苏秦印，波上虚迎范蠡船。\n正会星辰扶北极，却驱戈甲镇南燕。\n三尘上相逢明主，九合诸侯媿昔贤。\n看却中兴扶大业，杀身无路好归田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王铎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}